2d:T9eb,<h4>Features</h4><ul><li>The tethered drone emergency communication system mainly consists of a tethered box, onboard power supply, and communication base station. The tethered box integrates AC/DC conversion power, tethered cables, winding device, servo motors, communication modules, cooling systems, and control management systems. The tethered box converts AC power from the grid, generators, or mobile power sources into high-voltage DC power, transmitted through the tethered cable to the onboard power supply. The onboard power supply then converts high-voltage DC into low-voltage DC to power the drone and mission payloads such as base stations, enabling up to 12 hours of flight for long-duration emergency communication tasks.</li><li>The tethered relay system is mainly used for signal relay in emergency scenarios. The system has established deep partnerships with major telecommunication operators and can flexibly carry Tel equipment and shortwave communication devices to meet diverse communication needs. Typical application scenarios include: Rapidly building relay signal transmission links at disaster sites to ensure smooth rescue command and information transmission; building relay signal networks in areas with no signal coverage such as Gobi deserts and mines; and rapidly building local communication networks in complex mountainous environments to achieve 360° all-round wireless monitoring and ensuring real-time transmission and sharing of critical information.</li><li>Figure 1 FC-YJTX-01 Drone</li><li>Technical Specifications</li><li>Application Scenarios</li><li>Post-earthquake emergency communication setup</li><li>Flood emergency communication setup</li><li>Emergency communication setup after strong typhoon</li></ul><div class="product-images"><img src="/products/uav-systems/FC-YJTX-01-Emergency-Communication-Drone.png" alt="Emergency Communication Drone" style="max-width:100%;" /><img src="/products/media/v3_01应急通讯无人机_2.png" alt="Emergency Communication Drone" style="max-width:100%;" /><img src="/products/media/v3_01应急通讯无人机_3.png" alt="Emergency Communication Drone" style="max-width:100%;" /><img src="/products/media/v3_01应急通讯无人机_4.png" alt="Emergency Communication Drone" style="max-width:100%;" /><img src="/products/media/v3_01应急通讯无人机_5.png" alt="Emergency Communication Drone" style="max-width:100%;" /><img src="/products/media/v3_01应急通讯无人机_6.png" alt="Emergency Communication Drone" style="max-width:100%;" /></div>2:["$","div",null,{"className":"product-detail-page","children":["$","main",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"product-breadcrumb-nav","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"breadcrumb-path","children":[["$","$L2a",null,{"href":"/","children":"Home"}]," > ",["$","$L2a",null,{"href":"/products","children":"Product"}]," > ","Emergency Communication Drone"]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"overview","className":"product-hero","style":{"padding":"40px 0 20px"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"product-grid","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"gallery-main-area","children":["$","$L2b",null,{"images":["/products/uav-systems/FC-YJTX-01-Emergency-Communication-Drone.png"]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"product-info","children":[["$","h1",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"4.8rem","fontWeight":"900","marginBottom":"20px","lineHeight":"1.1"},"children":"Emergency Communication Drone"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"drone-specs","style":{"marginBottom":"40px"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.8rem","color":"#525a66","marginBottom":"8px","lineHeight":"1.4"},"children":"Endurance: ≥12h"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.8rem","color":"#525a66","marginBottom":"8px","lineHeight":"1.4"},"children":"Tethered Hovering Height: 150m (Customizable)"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.8rem","color":"#525a66","lineHeight":"1.4"},"children":"Rapid relay signal cons